128
00:13:31.907 --> 00:13:43.331
<v Daniel>First, they tested GPT-4.1 on those exact same abstracts. When summarizing the original abstracts, GPT-4.1 used causal language an astonishing 99.3% of the time. 99.3%. It completely failed to be the cold</v>

129
00:13:43.492 --> 00:13:44.112
<v Maya>calculating machine.</v>

130
00:13:47.705 --> 00:13:57.071
<v Daniel>Completely. And even with the rewritten perfectly cautious abstract, GPT 4.1 summary was causal 89.8% of the time.</v>

131
