132
00:14:00.533 --> 00:14:10.280
<v Daniel>Exactly. It took the methodological warning note to drop it to 41.7% and the explicit AI feedback warning to get it down to 30.3%.</v>

133
00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:15.323
<v Maya>So they wanted to see if this was just a quirk of one model, so they ran a grand prompt experiment.</v>

134
00:14:15.423 --> 00:14:20.030
<v Daniel>Right. They tested five different models, GPT-4.1, GPT-5.1, GPT-5.4, DeepSeqChat v3.2, and Anthropix CloudSonic 4.6.</v>

135
00:14:24.904 --> 00:14:26.465
<v Maya>A really good mix of the big players.</v>

136
