144
00:15:17.609 --> 00:15:32.535
<v Maya>Think about how you use AI at work. If you drop a dense PDF into Claude or ChatGPT and say, hey, give me the practical takeaways for my team so I can sound smart in this meeting, this data shows the AI is actively inventing a cause and effect relationship just to</v>

145
00:15:32.635 --> 00:15:33.095
